DESCRIPTION:National Pickle Day is marked on November 14 and has no documen
 ted origin. The pickled-vegetable industry's own trade association\, in bu
 siness since 1893\, did create a national pickle observance — but it is 
 a week in May\, and the association's site does not mention November 14 at
  all. What can be documented is the industry\, which is considerably older
  than the day attached to it.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/natio
 nal-pickle-day/
